---
import SectionHeading from './SectionHeading.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import cursorRegular from '@assets/sanctuary/ui/cursor.png';

const cursors = [
  { label: 'Regular', video: null },
  { label: 'NPC', video: '/sanctuary/ui/cursor-eye.webm' },
  { label: 'Interactive Object', video: '/sanctuary/ui/cursor-talking.webm' },
  { label: 'Walk', video: '/sanctuary/ui/cursor-walking.webm' },
];
---

<section class="ui-design grid-1440" id="ui-design">
  <SectionHeading title="UI Design" />
  <p class="caption">UI Design Approach</p>

  <p class="running narrow">
    A more minimalist style was chosen for the user interface, making the dialogue text easier to read
    against the game's rich illustrations, while still echoing some of the game's visual elements.
  </p>

  <div class="block">
    <p class="caption">Cursor</p>
    <p class="running">
      Thin corner frames echo the game's fine linework, and originated as a stylized rendering of water
      ripples.
    </p>
    <div class="cursor-grid">
      {cursors.map(c => (
        <div class="cursor-card">
          {c.video ? (
            <video src={c.video} autoplay loop muted playsinline></video>
          ) : (
            <Image src={cursorRegular} alt="Regular cursor" widths={[200]} sizes="140px" loading="lazy" />
          )}
          <p class="cursor-label">{c.label}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="block">
    <p class="caption">Speech UI</p>
    <p class="running">
      Black backgrounds tie the interface to black accents used in character and environment design —
      the in-game dialogue typeface was chosen for readability and a literary tone matching the game's
      lore.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .ui-design {
    padding-block: 4rem 6rem;
  }

  .ui-design > :global(*) {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
  }

  .block {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .caption {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #e8e8e8;
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
  }

  .running {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: #c9c9c9;
    line-height: 1.7;
    max-width: 60ch;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
  }

  .running.narrow {
    grid-column: span 3;
    max-width: 100%;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .running.narrow {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
    }
  }

  .cursor-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(140px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
    max-width: 700px;
  }

  .cursor-card {
    text-align: center;
    background: #121212;
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 1.5rem 1rem;
  }

  .cursor-card video,
  .cursor-card :global(img) {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 80px;
    margin-inline: auto;
    display: block;
  }

  .cursor-card p.cursor-label {
    margin: 0.75rem 0 0;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #e8e8e8;
  }
</style>
